          "branchId": "package",
          "location": "module.priorNarrativeBrief",
          "content": "陆照临走完最后一百级石阶时，天已经黑透。山道两旁的松树被风压得低伏，枝叶间不时落下大团积水，砸在他的斗笠上，像有人隔着黑暗敲门。",
          "authority": "confirmed_evidence",
          "validity": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "module:priorNarrativeBrief:paragraph-003",
          "kind": "recent_prose",
          "visibility": "player_known",
          "branchId": "package",
          "location": "module.priorNarrativeBrief",
          "content": "玄霄宗的山门就在前方。几盏灯悬在雨幕里，灯焰被风吹成细长的一线，远远看去，像钉在山腰上的星火。山门外立着一块半人高的青石，石面刻着“封山”二字，墨色被雨水冲得发淡。",
          "authority": "confirmed_evidence",
          "validity": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "module:priorNarrativeBrief:paragraph-004",
          "kind": "recent_prose",
          "visibility": "player_known",
          "branchId": "package",
          "location": "module.priorNarrativeBrief",
          "content": "陆照临摸了摸怀里的引荐文书。纸边已经潮了。他本应在山门落锁前把文书交给执事，成为玄霄宗最普通的一名外门弟子。父亲失踪后，这是他能找到的唯一去处。",
          "authority": "confirmed_evidence",
          "validity": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "module:priorNarrativeBrief:paragraph-005",
          "kind": "recent_prose",
          "visibility": "player_known",
          "branchId": "package",
          "location": "module.priorNarrativeBrief",
          "content": "三年前，陆沉舟离开北河城，说要替宗门押送一批引路灯。那之后，他没有回来。家里人说他死在了雪原，官府的文书却没有尸骨和遗物。",
          "authority": "confirmed_evidence",
          "validity": "confirmed"
        },
        {
